# Wireframe: No UI Changes

## Purpose & Flow Context

This change is scoped entirely to the data layer — API response type and store destructuring. No screens, components, layout, or visual elements are modified. Existing wireframes (see `openspec/specs/frontend/issues-store.md` for the issues list page) remain unchanged.

## Impact

| Aspect | Status |
|--------|--------|
| Layout regions | Unchanged |
| Components | Unchanged |
| States (empty/loading/populated/error) | Unchanged |
| Content & microcopy | Unchanged |
| Responsive behaviour | Unchanged |
| Accessibility | Unchanged |
